    "beige/solid_jeans.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 5,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:15",
   "text": "Everything else held equal — the first one's garment type goes on the no list.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 6,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:16",
   "text": "Also in the bag: Same everything, two garment types. The second one has never suited me.",
   "images": [
    "blue/solid_hoodie.jpg",
    "blue/solid_dress.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 7,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:17",
   "text": "Understood. The second one's garment type goes on the no list.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 8,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:10",
   "text": "Big closet purge tonight. The keep pile and the donate pile are both growing.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 9,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:11",
   "text": "Brutal honesty hour. What's surviving?",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 10,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:12",
   "text": "These two are unalike in every way but one color — the color I keep away from.",
   "images": [
    "brown/striped_long_coat.jpg",
    "brown/solid_jeans.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 11,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:13",
   "text": "One point of overlap — that shared color is the disqualifying one.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 12,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-08 19:14",
   "text": "Next out of the pile: I own these three in wildly different versions, but always this garment type.",
